  "acceptance": [
    "An explicit long-collaboration binding ties one canonical Workspace/Assistant/SessionKey to existing Task Ledger references without creating a second project/task/goal authority.",
    "The session generation is bound to a canonical local checkout or Git-registered managed worktree with branch/detached state, setup profile, revision and archive restore policy; Chat sends use the bound environment and fingerprint.",
    "Bindings recover after app restart and rename; handoff transfers the binding as session-pending until the first real generation is materialized.",
    "Archive, restore, pause, delete and reset generations produce explicit paused/invalid/pending/recovery states without deleting transcript, task or environment resources.",
    "Cross-workspace, missing owner/session/task, duplicate branch, active-run environment switch and revision conflicts fail closed; ordinary Chat does not auto-enter long collaboration."
  ],
